3367 0 obj
<<
/Title (FOR \(I = 0; I < 32; I++\) {     SUM1 += CONST[I] * INPUT[128 - I];     SUM2 += CONST[2*I] * INPUT[128 - \(2*I\)];     SUM3 += CONST[3*I] * INPUT[128 - \(3*I\)];     SUM4 += CONST[4*I] * INPUT[128 - \(4*I\)]; })
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3365 0 R
/Next 3369 0 R
>>
endobj
