3371 0 obj
<<
/Title (For small loops, the compiler already performs full unrolling automatically, so adding #pragma unroll\(4\) can degrade performance by reintroducing loop control instructions. However, for large loops, full unrolling is not feasible. In this case, #pragma unroll\(4\) enables partial unrolling, reducing loop overhead and increasing instruction-level parallelism.)
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3369 0 R
>>
endobj
